		"tip_station": "Welcome to the loading station! Tap the loads you want to carry, then press HIT THE ROAD. The more you carry, the more gold you earn, but every load must arrive intact.",
		"tip_pedals": "The GAS pedal is on the right, BRAKE / REVERSE on the left. Hold them, don't just tap. Go easy on bumps so your loads stay in the bed.",
